WEBVTT

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:07.710
Experiment No. 11
II Umbrella

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:10.030
Wow, it's really coming down...

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.770
I didn't even bring an umbrella today.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:17.710
I swear, Tanaka. You're 
still using an umbrella?

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:22.210
The age of humanity clinging
to some mere stick has passed...

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:24.630
Thanks to this item!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.330
What are you going to do?

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.330
Just you watch.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.250
A picture is worth a thousand words!

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.550
Hey! Don't go looking up my skirt!

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:51.830
Love always drives me, and yet

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:04.460
The wind against the glass 
creates an image of you

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:09.920
What "color" will that wind be today?
I want to experience it, completely

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:12.960
Off in the corners of the classroom

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:16.080
Through the tiniest of magics

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:20.880
Another miracle occurs!

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.260
A premonition of love

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:28.080
My heart shouldn't be so uneasy, 
I don't know what's next

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:33.000
Aah! What is it that throws 
my heart into turmoil?

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.500
This sudden spark

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:40.290
Love always drives me, and yet

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:44.880
Someone, someday, deliver 
these feelings to you!

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:49.290
First, we set up this 
device here on your head.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:53.170
Well, Tanaka? Can you tell what's different?

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:54.550
No, I can't.

00:01:54.550 --> 00:02:01.040
Correct! You couldn't know that because
it hasn't been turned on yet. SWITCH ON!

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.290
Next, we shall use this...

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.750
A mysterious device from 
which water shall emerge.

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.380
What? Hey!

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:21.170
Huh? I'm not wet.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:26.790
It's like it's some barrier!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:32.130
This is no barrier! The device deploys
an anti-gravitational field upward,

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:35.790
Creating a low-level gravitational wall
that deflects whatever it encounters.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:41.790
Attach this, and you yourself form part of an
"umbrella" and releasing umbrella-like properties.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:43.700
And so, we have named this device...

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:46.120
The II Umbrella!

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.580
So, it IS an umbrella.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:52.030
TANAKA]
Still, this is great, Ma'am.
It will change the whole history of umbrellas.

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:54.040
Indeed, indeed...

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.030
Now, humankind will be 
able to combat the rain!

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:01.130
The era that follows I, Ueno, 
shall live in prosperity and-

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:04.040
Gah!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:17.500
Ow. I swear, Ma'm. Why are 
you throwing kicks at... me?

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.790
Are you all right?

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:24.510
Wh-what do you mean?

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:26.960
You just hurt your butt, didn't you?

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.520
No, nothing of the sort!

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.520
But look, you're holding it.

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:35.000
Ma'am, we should go to the nurse's office.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.000
I shall not go!

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:37.830
Ma'am!

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:39.460
Ma'am...

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.880
It would be pointless for me to go!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.250
MA'AM!

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.540
There's something strange 
going on with your skirt.

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.010
It is not strange...

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.580
There's no way that's NOT strange!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.920
Something utterly strange is going on!

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:07.290
Ma'am...

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:11.210
I shall confirm the current state of affairs.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:16.580
You just stay there and wait, Tanaka!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:26.030
Ah. Ma'am, it's just tangled 
up with your panties.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:27.790
What is?!

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:30.750
That was a close call, I'd say.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:33.330
Hey! What's all "tangled up"?

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.500
Shut up, Tanaka! Just die already!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.290
You're scaring me...

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.540
I will now extract it, Ma'am.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.080
Be gentle.

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:48.500
Yes. I shall be gentle. Here goes. Everything

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:52.880
will be fine. All right, here 
I go. Just try to relax...

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.630
...Ma'am? Ma'am!

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.330
Ma'am!

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:00.880
What, Tanaka?

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:05.960
I didn't bring an umbrella today.
Please let me in there with you.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.420
Well, fine. But this is a special case.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.000
Thank goodness!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.080
Hey!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.000
I mean, I'm sticking out halfway.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:23.000
Please come a little closer.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.330
Okay, fine. Just move your hand.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:31.010
I swear.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:46.040
MATERNAL INSTINCT

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:47.130
in Charge

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:50.040
in Charge
Experiment No. 12
E-Q Booster

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.500
Experiment No. 12
E-Q Booster

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.000
It seems the time has come to settle this.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:01.210
Awaken...

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:06.970
Class 3-4

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.970
E-Q Booster!

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:15.170
The Epsilon-Quick Booster!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:20.750
It suppresses the so-called,
"fifth force, " protophobic X-Boson,

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:24.380
thus increasing or decreasing 
the strength of the wearer.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:27.670
It also has a lever of 
unknown purpose: the NAZO!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:30.290
So, it makes you stronger, right?

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:32.830
This is nothing so pedestrian!

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:38.210
This device instantaneously measures
the power level of one's opponent

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:41.500
and conveys the corresponding 
amount to the wearer!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.000
Currently, even one such as I...

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.670
have within me the same 
destructive power as YOU!

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.670
It's not like I'm that strong or anything...

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:52.870
Listen up, Tanaka:

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:55.200
it's the secondary sex characteristics 
that affect our physical performance,

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.420
causing a sizable gap between men and women.

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:02.540
These individual differences make it
hard for the average girl to overpower a man.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:07.040
Now then! What if that gap
in performance were eliminated?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:11.250
What we shall now undertake
is no mere sumo death match!

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:16.000
This is woman vs. man,
with the pride of each on the line...

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:20.210
Final Sumo Match from Hell!

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:23.830
Do you get it, Tanaka?
There'll be no need for you to hold back!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.080
Understood.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.580
This battle will be a 
clash of equal strength!

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.510
Ready...

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:32.670
Begin.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:36.290
The victor will be the one 
whose conviction is stronger!

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:42.630
Hey!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:50.130
Ma'am, I'm going to push 
you out of the ring now.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:56.830
I protest, you blockhead!

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.040
in Charge

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:09.230
Behold! This was a battle of equal strength,
yet I was the one who struggled.

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:12.200
"My, that's strange" is what 
you should be thinking!

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.120
Well, you told me not to 
pull any punches, so...

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:17.510
You could try to get a clue 
every once in a while!

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:21.150
If you simply LOOK, you'll 
see I haven't turned it on!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.460
Sorry.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:27.540
If the odds are in your favor,
you just go all-out for it, don't you?

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:28.960
Huh?

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.830
Never mind, dammit!

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.360
It's now or never.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:34.790
Did you turn it on?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:36.000
Yes, I did!

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:39.830
Ready... And they're off.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:45.080
Whoa! This is completely 
different from before!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:54.250
The E-Q Booster indeed 
functions as I explained,

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.490
but that's only the Booster itself.

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:56.960
E-Q BOOSTER
TANAKA

00:08:56.490 --> 00:09:00.380
In fact, the power of the wearer
is also added to the equation.

00:08:56.960 --> 00:09:02.250
E-Q BOOSTER
UEONO
TANAKA

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:05.040
Put simply, with only his own strength,
Tanaka is completely outclassed!

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:10.750
The skinny arms of a soft young girl...
you will yield to them, helpless to resist!

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:17.030
What's the matter, Tanaka?

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:21.330
Do you lack the strength of conviction?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.250
Huh?

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.500
in Charge

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.500
Come now. What's the matter?

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:31.420
Is THIS the best a man can do?

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:37.130
How pitiful you are. Are 
you a baby or something?

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:47.540
Hey! Where do you... think you're grabbing?!

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:50.520
For men...

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.170
This guy's losing it!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:01.670
For the pride of men everywhere!

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:04.630
Okay! Fine, I get it!

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:06.830
I cannot lose!

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.540
You've already won!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:12.960
I absolutely must not lose!

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:25.880
There, there.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:29.130
There, there.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.040
Snooze...
